                                text="&lt;p>&lt;b>&lt;span class=&quot;light-font&quot;>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-32-reg&quot;>Cham, January&amp;nbsp;24, 2025&lt;i> –&lt;/i> Michele Ravara has been appointed General Manager of AbbVie Switzerland as of January&amp;nbsp;2025. He succeeds Linn Mandahl, who was promoted to Vice President of AbbVie Region South, Europe.&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
